  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThe QUIET recipe was designed for tabletop photography that uses soft, natural light that shines into the studio.\nToned-down highlights and subdued colors preserve the gentle diffusion and soft shadows cast by light through a curtain. The recipe preserves the crisp impression and texture of objects, retaining the core sharpness while softening the overall feel.\n\nOriginally intended for indoor product shots and casual snaps, this recipe can also be used with a slight underexposure to evoke nostalgia in urban street scenes while preserving a sense of tranquility even under the strong light of the midday sun.\n\nIt also pairs beautifully with outdoor settings where the light isn't too harsh, such as overcast days or in window-lit corners, by softening and refining the ambient light.",
